    "answer_seconds": 2.010998641999322,
    "total_seconds": 2.5192003629927058,
    "answer": "For Tier 1 systems:\n\n- **RTO (Recovery Time Objective): 4 hours** \u2014 the target time to restore the system after a disruption.\n- **RPO (Recovery Point Objective): 1 hour** \u2014 the target maximum amount of data loss measured in time.\n\nSo, Tier 1 systems should be restored within 4 hours, with no more than 1 hour of data loss. [BUSINESS CONTINUITY AND DISASTER RECOVERY]",
